/45 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-7 px-2.5 text-[11.5px] coarse:h-10 tap-target"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg> Reset all balloon styles</button></div><p class="px-1 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Select a balloon on the page for fonts, colours, shapes and tails. Lettering edits are free — done by the editor, no AI cost.</p></section><section aria-labelledby="pe-script" class="space-y-2"><div class="mb-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><h3 id="pe-script" class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold leading-4 tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-[var(--ds-muted)]"><span class="shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-message-square h-3.5 w-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 17a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6.828a2 2 0 0 0-1.414.586l-2.202 2.202A.71.71 0 0 1 2 21.286V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h16a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg></span><span class="truncate">Script</span></h3></div><div class="min-w-0"><label for="_r_e_" class="mb-0.5 block px-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Page summary</label><textarea rows="2" id="_r_e_" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-transparent px-2 py-1 coarse:min-h-[44px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--ds-faint)] hover:border-[var(--ds-hairline)] focus:border-[#D97757]/50 focus:bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] focus:outline-none transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] text-base sm:text-[13.5px] coarse:text-base resize-none leading-relaxed" style="height: auto;">Page 1 summary</textarea></div><div class="min-w-0"><label for="_r_f_" class="mb-0.5 block px-2 text-[11px] font-medium text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Layout (rows of panels)</label><textarea rows="2" id="_r_f_" placeholder="Row 1: one wide panel. Row 2: two equal panels." class="w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-transparent px-2 py-1 coarse:min-h-[44px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--ds-faint)] hover:border-[var(--ds-hairline)] focus:border-[#D97757]/50 focus:bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] focus:outline-none transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] text-base sm:text-[13.5px] coarse:text-base resize-none leading-relaxed" style="height: auto;">Row 1: one wide panel (panel 1). Row 2: two equal panels side by side (panels 2–3).</textarea></div><p class="px-2 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Dialogue edits update the balloons instantly — no redraw needed. Layout and action edits mark the page out of date.</p><div class="space-y-2"><section aria-label="Panel 1" class="rounded-2xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] p-2.5"><header class="mb-1 flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><span class="grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--ds-well-strong)] text-[10.5px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[var(--ds-muted)]">1</span><p class="min-w-0 truncate text-[11.5px] text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Wide · Establishing · no one</p></header><div class="min-w-0"><label for="_r_g_" class="sr-only">Panel 1 action</label><textarea rows="2" id="_r_g_" placeholder="What we see in this panel" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-transparent bg-transparent px-2 py-1 coarse:min-h-[44px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] placeholder:text-[var(--ds-faint)] hover:border-[var(--ds-hairline)] focus:border-[#D97757]/50 focus:bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] focus:outline-none transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] text-[12.5px] resize-none leading-relaxed" style="height: auto;">The spice market at dawn, stalls opening under striped awnings.</textarea></div><div class="mt-1.5 space-y-1.5"><div data-testid="line-row" data-line-id="pg_1_l1" class="space-y-1 rounded-xl border p-1.5 transition-colors duration-200 motion-reduce:transition-none border-transparent bg-[var(--ds-well)]"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-1.5"><select aria-label="Line type" class="h-7 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] px-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] focus:border-[var(--ds-accent)] focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-50 coarse:h-11 w-[7.5rem] shrink-0"><option value="speech">Speech</option><option value="thought">Thought</option><option value="whisper">Whisper</option><option value="shout">Shout</option><option value="caption">Caption</option><option value="sfx">Sound effect</option></select><select aria-label="Speaker" disabled="" class="h-7 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-strong)] px-1.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--ds-ink)] focus:border-[var(--ds-accent)] focus:outline-none disabled:opacity-50 coarse:h-11 flex-1"><option value="">Narration</option><optgroup label="Others (adds nobody to the panel)"><option value="ch_maya">Maya</option><option value="ch_arjun">Arjun</option><option value="ch_vendor">Vendor</option></optgroup></select><button type="button" aria-label="Remove line" title="Remove line" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-[var(--ds-muted)] hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] hover:text-[var(--ds-ink)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#D97757]/45 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 h-7 w-7 coarse:h-11 coarse:w-11"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap