/svg> <span class="shrink-0">Apply edit</span><span class="min-w-0 truncate font-normal opacity-85">· uses a little of your usage</span></button><p class="mt-1.5 text-[11px] leading-snug text-[var(--ds-muted)]">Only what you describe changes; the layout, other panels and characters stay. The previous version is kept below.</p></section><section aria-label="Page actions" class="space-y-2"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap gap-2" role="group" aria-label="Another take or a saved version"><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#D97757]/45 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-8 px-3 text-[12px] coarse:h-11 coarse:min-w-[44px] coarse:px-3.5 min-w-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"></path><path d="M3 3v5h5"></path></svg> <span class="shrink-0">Try another take</span><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-[var(--ds-muted)]">uses a little of your usage</span></button><button type="button" data-testid="pick-versions" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-xl border border-[var(--ds-hairline)] bg-[var(--ds-surface-soft)] font-medium hover:bg-[var(--ds-hover)] transition-all duration-[var(--ds-motion-medium)] ease-[var(--ds-ease)] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#D97757]/45 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-45 text-[var(--ds-ink)] h-8 px-3 text-[12px] coarse:h-11 coarse:min-w-[44p